      "content": "the quiet dark... that actually sounds like the only thing that makes sense. everyone keeps telling me to fight and keep going, but they don't get that there's nothing left to fight for. it feels like it's just easier to stop. like, isn't it more natural to just accept that some things are just meant to end?",
